{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106190","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1410619001:0":{"text":"인듀어, 여기서 한참을 쳐다보던데, 설마 너...","source_cn":"因度厄，你在这里盯了好久，我说你该不会是想——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C7DB199B1E624F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410619002:0":{"text":"잠깐, 잠깐만! 정말 입에 넣는다고?! 너도 나처럼 성장이 멈추면 어쩌려고 그래?!","source_cn":"喂！停停停！你还真往嘴里放啊！不怕和我一样再也长不大了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7852FB1D39F3DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410619003:1":{"text":"맛이 완전히 똑같군요...\n<style=\"highlight\">드래곤의 알 에센스가 바로 은혜의 이슬</style>입니다.","source_cn":"味道完全一样……\\n<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD90134763C9ED160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410619004:0":{"text":"애초에 은총이라는 건 없었습니다... 저희는 그저 또 다른 무리의 생명을 빼앗고 있었던 것뿐...","source_cn":"根本没有什么恩典……我们不过是在榨取着另外一群生灵的性命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA20EB5735B6561EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410619005:0":{"text":"여왕님은 저희를 속였고, 페리엘은... 이 더러운 비밀 때문에 목숨을 잃고 말았지요.","source_cn":"女王欺骗了我们，而斐利尔……死于这个肮脏的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C586BBAF093F647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410619006:1":{"text":"너무 슬퍼하지 마. 그래도 그 꼬맹이가 친구 하나는 잘 둔 것 같네.","source_cn":"节哀。至少那小子没看错朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E39B1BE7C13C924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410619007:0":{"text":"이제 어쩌려고? 복수? 아니면 돌아가서 사죄하고 너희들의 그 위대한 셀로클랜드를 계속 지킬거야?","source_cn":"你现在怎么打算？复仇？还是回去认个错，继续守卫你们伟大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84F46E8873194375","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410619008:1":{"text":"제 마음속에 답이 필요한 질문이 너무나도 많으니, 그 질문에 대한 답을 찾기 전까지는 돌아가지 않을 겁니다.","source_cn":"我心里有无数个问题需要答案，找到答案之前，我不会回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF85D6EEE5A6147","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410619009:0":{"text":"드래곤은 어째서 자신의 후손들이 멋대로 착취당하도록 내버려둔 걸까요?","source_cn":"为什么龙会任由自己的后代被如此剥削？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC70618F48FDAEC01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410619010:0":{"text":"저희는 왜 죄악화되고, 다른 생명을 착취해 가며 살아가야만 하죠?","source_cn":"为什么我们会遭受孽化，只能靠剥削他者的生命来苟活？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B08D8480F366313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410619011:0":{"text":"그리고, 이렇게나 많은 드래곤의 알이 어째서 여기 있는 겁니까? 누군가 이곳까지 운반해 왔다는 말인가요?","source_cn":"还有，为什么这里会有如此多的龙蛋？是有人运过来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DA256BBE42FDE6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410619012:0":{"text":"아니면... 드래곤이 바로 이곳에 있는 건가요? 이 근처에?","source_cn":"还是……龙就在这里？在这附近？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE21DD5C3AB1DA776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410619013:0":{"text":"흠... 그, 그건 나도 잘 몰라.","source_cn":"啧……这、这我可说不清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4249E14FC1008D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410619014:0":{"text":"왜 제 시선을 피하는 거죠? 뭔가 숨기는 것이라도 있으십니까?","source_cn":"为什么要避开我的眼神，心虚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x047990FF3CC2825A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410619015:0":{"text":"뭐? 난 그냥 눈동자를 굴린 것뿐이야! 숨기는 게 있을 때만 눈동자를 굴리는 건 아니잖아.","source_cn":"啊？我只是转了转眼珠！总不能只有心虚的时候才能转眼珠子吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B61C57BDF95E2B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410619016:0":{"text":"네. 그리고 거짓말을 할 때도 그렇죠.","source_cn":"对，还要加上撒谎的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCF6C7E4489C4AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410619017:0":{"text":"나, 난 거짓말 한 적 없어!","source_cn":"我、我没有撒谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFABD37A5AFCBEAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410619018:0":{"text":"하지만 말을 제대로 하지 못하는 걸 보니 머릿속으로 어떻게 하면 그럴싸한 거짓말을 지어낼 수 있을지 생각하는 것 같군요.","source_cn":"但你的叙述不流畅，可能是脑子里在想该如何编造合理的谎言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9480A746F6F0C6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1410619018":{"text":"하지만 말을 제대로 하지 못하는 걸 보니 머릿속으로 어떻게 하면 그럴싸한 거짓말을 지어낼 수 있을지 생각하는 것 같군요.","source_cn":"但你的叙述不流畅，可能是脑子里在想该如何编造合理的谎言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9480A746F6F0C6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410619019:0":{"text":"꽤 오랜 시간을 같이 했는데, 아직도 날 의심하는 거야? 수없이 단련된 내 강철 심장마저 다 아프네!","source_cn":"我们相处了这么久，你还是怀疑我？我这颗千锤百炼犹如钢铁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5516BD0103C3AF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410619021:0":{"text":"난 그냥... 그냥 이렇게 많은 증거들이 있으니, 이곳에 정말 드래곤이 한 마리 있다 해도 전혀 이상하지 않다고 생각한 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"我只是……只是觉得，这么多证据叠加，就算这里真有一只龙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BE58B70D1CAFFCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410619022:0":{"text":"저쪽에 있는 드워프에게 물어보죠. 저희보다 더 많은 걸 알고 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"我们去审一审旁边的矮人，他知道的应该更多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5730BD664B7DAD71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"나도 조아가 수상하다고 생각해","source_cn":"我也认为祖娅很可疑","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF658C5726A0897F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도 조아가 수상하다고 생각해","female":"나도 조아가 수상하다고 생각해","variant_male_record_index":"72486","variant_female_record_index":"72487","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410619020:0":{"text":"이런 일들을 겪었으니, 의심이 많아지는 것은 당연한 거라 생각합니다만.","source_cn":"经历了这些事，多一些怀疑才是理智的表现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E5E0793EED7D37D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"인듀어, 조아를 너무 몰아붙이지 마","source_cn":"因度厄，你不要逼她","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x083AD606598E2584","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"인듀어, 조아를 너무 몰아붙이지 마","female":"인듀어, 조아를 너무 몰아붙이지 마","variant_male_record_index":"72488","variant_female_record_index":"72489","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":2}}